+- §1.1 is meta (Grok `$design`, OMX, Brad Frost talks). Fine in appendix; weak as §1 of a shipping IA spec.
+- Risks dual-review energy spent on philosophy tables (P1–P7) that mostly restate three-mode + ADR-020.
